# Source materials supplied for content extraction (raw Annual Report, original
# logo file, raw masjid/project photos) — not needed to build or run the site.
# The Annual Report contains internal/financial correspondence not meant for a
# public repo, and the raw photos are full-size WhatsApp/camera exports.
# Processed assets actually used by the site live under public/images/.
/Documents/
/logo.jpeg
/images/
